    "title": "Lorain County's only youth crisis shelter closes after budget cut - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Hannah Drown, cleveland.com ,\n14 hours ago ELYRIA, Ohio — For some children removed from unsafe homes in Lorain County, the Turning Point youth shelter was the first place they had ever slept through the night without fear. Now that refuge is gone. Turning Point — the county’s only short-term emergency shelter for youth in crisis... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 5",
